  A. CARDINAL BRANDING: The Cardinal project name and the Cardinal visual
     identifiers and interface included with the Cardinal control plane.
  B. CARDINAL APP MANAGER: The original source code for discovering, starting,
     stopping, and managing Cardinal apps and their private data.
  C. CARDINAL DB: The original Cardinal DB source, including its JSON
     collection storage, validation, transaction, recovery, and backup logic.
  D. CARDINAL APP API: The original app API, runtime helpers, and client used
     by Cardinal apps to access their own configuration and send notifications.
  E. DOCUMENTATION: The Cardinal- and Cardinal DB-specific documentation
     distributed with this source.

